message: "If you use this software in research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cancer Biomarker Discovery Pipeline"
version: 0.3.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23433739"
authors:
  - family-names: Famenaghawon
    given-names: Freedom
    email: f.e.amenaghawon@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-1457-809X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/famenaghawon/cancer-biomarker-discovery"
url: "https://famenaghawon.github.io/cancer-biomarker-discovery/"
license: MIT
abstract: |
  End-to-end pipeline for cancer biomarker discovery on synthetic and
  real TCGA-BRCA data. Rigorous DE (log2FC + Welch t-test + BH-FDR),
  leakage-safe ML with nested CV, Cox survival analysis via lifelines,
  full ComBat batch correction with covariate preservation, and
  multi-omics methylation support.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - cancer-genomics
  - biomarker-discovery
  - differential-expression
  - machine-learning
  - reproducibility
  - tcga
  - methylomics
